OL,3,GNEWSAEighth teen charged over boy's
OL,4,Asuspected murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn eighth teenager has been charged
OL,7,Fwith murder following the fatal
OL,8,Fstabbing of a 17-year-old boy.
OL,10,FBilal Nisar died in hospital with stab
OL,11,Fwounds after being found injured at
OL,12,FKingsway Recreation Ground in Luton at
OL,13,Fabout 18:30 BST on 24 July.
OL,15,FA 17-year-old boy, who legally cannot
OL,16,Fbe named due to his young age, appeared
OL,17,Fat Luton Magistrates' Court charged
OL,18,Fwith murder, violent disorder and
OL,19,Fpossession of an offensive weapon.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
